    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nUnfortunately, this is out of scope for 'mini.diff'. The reason is that it is [designed around the idea of comparing current buffer text and some single reference text](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/b1af49d98233180c6045e81f4aef5b663d032b62/doc/mini-diff.txt#L10-L11). The reference text for the default Git source is the file's text in the Git index (i.e. staged), so 'mini.diff' can't know specifically about hunks which are already staged.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
            "created_at": "2025-01-06T12:18:47Z",
